#: ../../operations.rst:172
msgid ""
"By the end of this chapter, we should be able to start a load balancer "
"with one command, write an edge topology in JLV, forward TCP and UDP, "
"terminate TLS with HAProxy-style PEM bundles or with certificates that "
"Sibuna obtains itself, route HTTP by host name and path to HTTP/1.1, "
"HTTP/2 and HTTP/3 servers, turn the firewall on or off per name, limit "
"rates, check server health, drain and add servers while the daemon runs, "
"and reload the file without dropping flows."
